    "body": "Part of #36692.\n\nAdd `MakeTx()` and use it in `TestPackageSelection` and `TestPrioritisedMining` so each transaction is fully specified where it is created, instead of overwriting the `prevout` and `nValue` of the previous one. Also build the `CreateBigSigOpsTx()` and `CreateBigSigOpsCluster()` transactions in place.\n\nOne implicit dependency is now explicit: BulkTransaction() pads the output script of hashFreeTx2, and the next two transactions inherited it. Their size matters for the fee rate checks, so the padded script is now passed to `MakeTx()` explicitly.\n\nThe txid, wtxid and fee of every transaction added to the mempool are unchanged.",
